The [[Imperial Bureau of Standards]] maintained '''an office''' in a [[skyscraper]] part of [[Imperial City]] on the [[planet]] [[Coruscant]]. It housed thousands of employees for the Departments of [[Fuel Purity]], [[Redundancy]], [[Verification]] and [[Weights and Gauges]] as well as a [[Data Center (Imperial Bureau of Standards)|Data Center]]. [[Flob]] worked as a [[supervisor]] in this office<ref name="Announcement" /> in [[5 BBY]]<ref name="Date">"Announcement" takes place in between "[[Kassa (episode)|Kassa]]," which dates itself to [[5 BBY]], and "[[Narkina 5 (episode)|Narkina 5]]," which {{SW|url=andor-s1-e8-trivia-gallery|text="Narkina 5" Trivia Gallery &#124; Andor}} {{C|Slide 6}} dates to 5 [['ABY-BBY' dating system|BBY]].</ref> and was the one who hired [[Syril Karn]] following his uncle [[Harlo]]'s intervention.<ref name="Announcement" />

